# Rot Farm Mortipede needs a creature card to leave your graveyard. Bot1's graveyard holds only Faithless Looting and two Plains when
# Bot2's Tormod's Crypt exiles it on turn 2: the Mortipede stays a 3/4 with no keywords. Bot2 then casts its own Faithless Looting,
# discarding its Memnite and Ornithopter, and exiles that graveyard with a second Crypt: the creature cards leave an opponent's
# graveyard, so the Mortipede still does not trigger. (The positive control, the same exile with creature cards in Bot1's graveyard,
# is rot-farm-mortipede-gets-plus-one-plus-zero-menace-and-lifelink-once-when-creature-cards-leave-your-graveyard.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Rot Farm Mortipede
Faithless Looting
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Tormod's Crypt
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x14

